  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Intelligence Is Not the Model",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The model is not the product",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The model is the ingredient",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The model is a snapshot of accumulated decisions",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The loop is the engine that keeps accumulating",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If you build AI systems that don't capture their own decisions, you're building castles on sand. Every session resets. Every conversation starts from zero. Every failure is a mystery because you have no record of why it failed",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sovereign Intelligence Stack is a 5-layer architecture where each layer produces data that makes the next layer better",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing is wasted",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The AI ecosystem is exploding",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sovereign Intelligence Stack is the glue",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Every AI decision should be captured as an immutable record. This is the foundation",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is **Git for AI**. Every recipe is an immutable commit",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "2. **FTS5 is fast** — Full-text search at query time, not build time",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "3. **Immutable records** — Append-only schema. Recipes are never modified, only extended",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Not all tasks are equal",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is **reinforcement learning for evaluation**. The loop doesn't just check — it generates new ways to check, detects when its own checks are drifting, and improves over time",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The knowledge graph has **3,468 edges** (from my earlier work on knowledge graphs). Each node represents a concept, each edge represents a relationship",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Access frequency** — How often is it used",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Over time, irrelevant memories are pruned",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Relevant memories are retained and prioritized",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "6. **Day 30**: You have 1,000 recipes, 500 nodes, and your system is self-improving",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is compounding.** Each day makes the next day better. The system is learning from itself",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The working implementation is in the [sovereign-intelligence-stack](https://github",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "2. **Debug failures** — Every failure is a recipe you can investigate",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "6. **Maintain sovereignty** — All data stays local, all decisions are captured",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    }
  ],
